    Retire Game mode: no Game card, start-sheet speed picker, lives or timer; its banners move onto Exam
    
    Lanterns: pass an Exam on 10 units. Great Wave: 100% in Exam on 10 units.
    Thunderhead: 100% in Exam on every unit. Each still honours the old Game
    count, so nobody loses one they earned. The dead hardcore10 feat goes; the
    Masked One keeps its legacy Hardcore clause. A saved Game mode loads as
    Drill. Old history entries keep their Game label.
    
    Restorable: git revert this commit (see retired/game-mode.md).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
